!read oef/special.phtml mathmlinput [\large{ 100\; \overset{\phantom{xx}+$val23\%\phantom{xx}}{\underset{\times reply2}{\mapsto}}\; reply3\; \overset{\phantom{xx}-$val32\%\phantom{xx}}{\underset{\times reply5}{\mapsto}}\; reply6\;	\overset{\phantom{xx}+$val25\%\phantom{xx}}{\underset{\times reply8}{\mapsto}}\; reply10}],5	reply2	reply3	reply5	reply6	reply8	reply10 
$()	</li></ul>	 
